            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Carson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent dip! One thing I did differently was to use real bacon crisped and chopped. A word of caution here if you choose to use real bacon is that it WILL get soggy and wimpy if it sits for more than a few hours. Make your bacon up ahead and store in a separate air tight container until ready to serve, then just stir it in."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CookingWithShelia"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Although I liked the dip, I do believe the flavor is heavy on the miracle whip side (I'm not a fan). I added green onions after my initial taste and I think it definitely added flavor. The next time I make it, I'll use real bacon instead of the real bacon bits...",
            "datePublished": "2024-06-25T02:28:23.911Z"
          },
